      {
        "id": 197187,
        "name": "Phantom5613",
        "username": "Phantom5613",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-30T18:55:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Of course, last night I had a dream that I was running around trying to get people interested in an Oblivaeon fight, while trying to figure out both how to set him up and how he played.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Unrelated/Related: I had a dream last night that I got a bunch of SotM stuff in cardboard boxes and metal tins(Much like the one for 'Are you Mental?', a neat little game by Robert Turk) which were open on my doorstep with a bunch of loose cards inside them. The cover on one of the tins had Legacy and Baron Blade facing opposite directions, but Blade was wearing a Legacy-suit with a red nuclear symbol on his chest. Legacy was all scowly and loocking back at Baron Blade, and Blade was making his trademark 'Yeah, what you gonna do about it?' look back at him. There were other characters, but I only noticed those two.</p>",
